        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Step</i> into a <strong>fantasy roguelike adventure</strong> where every run brings new challenges and cosmetic skins. Play from a third-person perspective and fight your way through diverse enemies, randomized items, and ever-changing encounters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While tha maps were not random generated, but they contain unique variations. —and at the start of every run, a <strong>random map</strong> is chosen to keep the experience fresh. Prove your strength in the <strong>Boss Arena mode</strong>, where victory grants you “map key” rewards, such as the ability to select your preferred map or reach a map that is not included in the random map pool. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemy Variety &amp; Specialization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Face off against a wide roster of enemies across multiple categories: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Melee</strong>, <strong>Ranged</strong>, <strong>Mage</strong>, <strong>Summoner</strong>, and of course, <strong>Bosses</strong>.  <br>Each category features both weaker and stronger variants, with enemies specializing in unique combat roles. For example: </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fire Mage</strong> – heavy-hitting but slow. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frost Mage</strong> – balanced damage with a stunning freeze effect. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcane Mage</strong> – weaker attacks but faster casting speed. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some enemies have <strong>passive</strong> abilities in addition to their active abilities., such as <strong>self-healing</strong>, extreme movement <strong>speed boosts</strong>, or <strong>devastating</strong> offensive skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Rewards</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can receive <strong>cosmetic skins</strong> as a reward for completing the specified number of maps. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>continuous updates</strong> with <strong>new maps</strong>, and <strong>features</strong> inspired by community feedback. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills, adapt to randomized challenges, and carve your path to mastery. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to die, again and again </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random enemy , item spawns </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal combat, unforgiving enemies </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New run always with different challenges </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate roguelike </p></li></ul>",
